  "title": "结晶方法",
  "pattern_refs": ["pattern:method-procedure-v2"],
  "summary": "从溶液中提取溶质的方法，包括蒸发结晶和降温结晶。",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "goal",
      "title": "目标",
      "section_type": "definition",
      "content": [
        "从溶液中提取溶质，得到晶体"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade9-all-in-one:1-1-2:crystallization"]
    },
    {
      "id": "conditions",
      "title": "适用条件",
      "section_type": "assessment",
      "content": [
        "蒸发结晶：适用于溶解度受温度影响较小的物质",
        "降温结晶：适用于溶解度随温度变化较大的物质"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade9-all-in-one:1-1-2:crystallization"]
    },
    {
      "id": "steps",
      "title": "操作步骤",
      "section_type": "procedure",
      "content": [
        "蒸发结晶：通过蒸发使溶剂不断减少，直至形成饱和溶液，继而析出晶体",
        "降温结晶：冷却热饱和溶液，使溶质从溶液中结晶析出"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade9-all-in-one:1-1-2:crystallization"]
    }
  ],
